WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:01.431
- Good morning Believe Nation.

00:00:01.431 --> 00:00:02.340
It's Evan.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.314
My one word is believe,
and I believe in people

00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:06.464
more than they believe in themselves,

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:09.033
and my sincere hope is
that if you see in yourself

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.911
what I see in you, you'll be
able to change the planet.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.457
So to help you on your
journey, today's message is,

00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:15.874
make today count.

00:00:16.956 --> 00:00:18.552
Over to you, Nick Vujicic.

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:20.401
(rooster crows)

00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:23.530
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.406
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:30.070
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.244
- I want to make sure
that every single day

00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:35.956
that you are alive,
that you make it count,

00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:38.434
and you take the sweeter choices of life

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.230
that God has given you.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:41.999
Because I want to ask you right now,

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:44.773
if this was your last
30 seconds to breathe,

00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:47.780
how would you be remembered?

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.780
Were you a giver, encourager?

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.137
Or were you a taker,
were you a bitter person?

00:00:52.137 --> 00:00:55.359
Did you encourage people
to, in your actions,

00:00:55.359 --> 00:00:59.756
in your life, did you help them,
or did you discourage them?

00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:02.316
Did you take that time to
say, hey how're you doing,

00:01:02.316 --> 00:01:03.608
and they looked to the ground and say,

00:01:03.608 --> 00:01:05.120
oh, you know, I'm okay.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.980
No, look at me, how are you doing?

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.594
We are here for one another.

00:01:08.594 --> 00:01:10.280
This is the ministry.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.478
This is Jesus.

00:01:11.478 --> 00:01:12.978
This is the light.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.472
And I want to tell you, I'm
sure that if any one of us

00:01:17.472 --> 00:01:20.600
was at a road, and there
was a three year old kid

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.636
in the middle of the street sitting down,

00:01:22.636 --> 00:01:26.656
playing with rocks in the
street, and a bus was coming,

00:01:26.656 --> 00:01:28.679
and the bus was about to kill him,

00:01:28.679 --> 00:01:31.445
you have plenty of time
to get up off your seat,

00:01:31.445 --> 00:01:32.513
go save that kid.

00:01:32.513 --> 00:01:33.793
Will you save that kid?

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:34.992
Of course you will.

00:01:34.992 --> 00:01:36.717
You don't know his name,
you're going to save that kid.

00:01:36.717 --> 00:01:38.681
You don't know his religion,
you're going to save that kid.

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:40.265
You don't know his sexual orientation,

00:01:40.265 --> 00:01:41.615
you're going to save that kid.

00:01:41.615 --> 00:01:42.448
Because, why?

00:01:42.448 --> 00:01:46.615
We are the light and love and
the bridge to Jesus Christ.

00:01:47.903 --> 00:01:52.282
We need to understand that it's
not just doing what we think

00:01:52.282 --> 00:01:54.532
we need to achieve or have.

00:01:55.776 --> 00:01:58.063
Some people think that things get easier

00:01:58.063 --> 00:01:59.261
when you get married.

00:01:59.261 --> 00:02:01.831
Uh uh, go talk to some married
people. (audience laughs)

00:02:01.831 --> 00:02:05.204
Some single people are
like, oh I'm not happy,

00:02:05.204 --> 00:02:08.109
but I know I'm going to be
happy when I get married.

00:02:08.109 --> 00:02:09.378
Dude, if you ain't happy single,

00:02:09.378 --> 00:02:10.892
you ain't going to be happy married.

00:02:10.892 --> 00:02:12.274
Can you hear an amen?

00:02:12.274 --> 00:02:13.107
(audience laughs)

00:02:13.107 --> 00:02:14.216
Yeah, you guys already know it right.

00:02:14.216 --> 00:02:15.321
You've got to talk that.

00:02:15.321 --> 00:02:17.019
So what do you want?

00:02:17.019 --> 00:02:18.075
How do you act?

00:02:18.075 --> 00:02:19.075
Who are you?

00:02:20.982 --> 00:02:22.399
Make today count.

00:02:24.912 --> 00:02:25.745
Dream big.

00:02:27.035 --> 00:02:28.752
And never give up.

00:02:28.752 --> 00:02:29.942
- One of the most common
questions that I get asked

00:02:29.942 --> 00:02:32.205
in a lot of interviews is
usually right at the end.

00:02:32.205 --> 00:02:33.985
They say, do you have
anything else to share

00:02:33.985 --> 00:02:34.818
with our audience?

00:02:34.818 --> 00:02:36.054
Do you have anything else
to share, or anything else

00:02:36.054 --> 00:02:38.372
that's on your mind that you
want to let us know about.

00:02:38.372 --> 00:02:41.990
And I almost always will
default to, make today count.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.286
Make what you're doing
right now really important.

00:02:44.286 --> 00:02:48.649
- One final word for
influencers, just to go out there

00:02:48.649 --> 00:02:50.564
and create their best
work and put their message

00:02:50.564 --> 00:02:52.130
out there in the world.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.698
- It's important, just
remember that what you're doing

00:02:54.698 --> 00:02:56.315
is important.

00:02:56.315 --> 00:02:59.209
Stop shrinking down, stop
waiting until tomorrow.

00:02:59.209 --> 00:03:02.623
The work that you're
doing in this very moment

00:03:02.623 --> 00:03:04.532
better mean something that
you want to go and show

00:03:04.532 --> 00:03:06.564
your grandkids.

00:03:06.564 --> 00:03:09.420
The more that you spend your
time thinking that this moment

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.797
right now is important,
the more you're going to do

00:03:11.797 --> 00:03:13.452
important things.

00:03:13.452 --> 00:03:15.840
I say that because a lot
of you guys are not taking

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.269
enough action.

00:03:17.269 --> 00:03:19.708
You're not living up to your capabilities,

00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:21.457
because you feel there's so much time.

00:03:21.457 --> 00:03:24.211
Because you may know where you want to go,

00:03:24.211 --> 00:03:25.929
you may have belief
that you can get there,

00:03:25.929 --> 00:03:27.452
you may know all the steps
that you need to take

00:03:27.452 --> 00:03:28.937
to be able to do that thing,

00:03:28.937 --> 00:03:32.208
and part of that also, means
because you figured it out,

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:34.756
you don't actually want
to go and do the steps,

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:37.490
because the most fun part was
figuring out the strategy.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.380
The hard part is actually
doing the execution.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.522
And so, you know that it'll
work, but you don't want

00:03:41.522 --> 00:03:43.019
to do the work, day in, day out,

00:03:43.019 --> 00:03:44.430
to actually go out and do it.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.766
And so, the mental exercise
was more the challenge,

00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.798
than actually going and
building the company.

00:03:48.798 --> 00:03:50.426
But, we feel there's a lot of time.

00:03:50.426 --> 00:03:52.466
Okay, I could do it tomorrow,
I could do it the next day,

00:03:52.466 --> 00:03:53.494
I could do it the next day.

00:03:53.494 --> 00:03:54.861
You know, you can always push it off.

00:03:54.861 --> 00:03:57.424
And it's not pushing
it off until next year,

00:03:57.424 --> 00:03:59.740
or in 3 years, some of you do that,

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.630
but for a lot of people, it's
still just pushing it off

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.821
until the next day or the next week.

00:04:03.821 --> 00:04:06.050
Challenge is, it still
doesn't happen the next day,

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:06.883
or the next week.

00:04:06.883 --> 00:04:09.085
There's always a reason
why to push it off again,

00:04:09.085 --> 00:04:11.008
and to push it off again,
and to push it off again,

00:04:11.008 --> 00:04:14.256
and you know, it's nice outside,
so I'm going to go for a walk,

00:04:14.256 --> 00:04:16.453
or you know, family issues
that you have to deal with,

00:04:16.453 --> 00:04:18.261
or, or, or, or, or.

00:04:18.261 --> 00:04:20.484
There's always something, right?

00:04:20.484 --> 00:04:23.096
You're never going to
have the time to do it.

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:25.767
It's never going to have the
perfect moment where ahhh,

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:28.184
you know, like hours just
free up magically every day

00:04:28.184 --> 00:04:30.907
of your life, to be able
to work on this thing.

00:04:30.907 --> 00:04:32.990
And so you have to make it count.

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:34.248
Make today count.

00:04:34.248 --> 00:04:37.632
If you had a practice
of waking up every day,

00:04:37.632 --> 00:04:39.821
and whatever it takes
to get you feeling like

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:41.066
today is important,

00:04:41.066 --> 00:04:43.909
whether it's reading a
book that motivates you,

00:04:43.909 --> 00:04:46.023
watching an Entspresso
video in the morning,

00:04:46.023 --> 00:04:48.662
whether it's remembering
that what you do today,

00:04:48.662 --> 00:04:51.447
you want to show your
grandkids one day and be proud,

00:04:51.447 --> 00:04:53.134
of like, I made this thing happen today.

00:04:53.134 --> 00:04:56.121
Whatever that thing is,
that feeling inside you,

00:04:56.121 --> 00:04:58.547
that doesn't just make
you think bold thoughts,

00:04:58.547 --> 00:05:00.041
but that today matters.

00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:02.976
That what I do today,
actually makes a difference.

00:05:02.976 --> 00:05:04.268
What I'm about to do in the next hour,

00:05:04.268 --> 00:05:06.105
actually makes a difference.

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:08.439
Whatever you need to do to
get yourself in that mindset,

00:05:08.439 --> 00:05:11.968
if you did that consistently,
your output would explode.

00:05:11.968 --> 00:05:14.730
Because even as I'm saying
this, a lot of you will be

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.178
understanding it, but
you still won't do it.

00:05:17.178 --> 00:05:19.169
And you'll still feel like,
you know that idea that I have?

00:05:19.169 --> 00:05:21.079
I could do it tomorrow,
I'll still do it tomorrow.

00:05:21.079 --> 00:05:22.399
I'll do it, I'll get it
done, I'll do it tomorrow.

00:05:22.399 --> 00:05:24.350
And you've lost today.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.829
And even if you do do it
tomorrow, you've lost today.

00:05:26.829 --> 00:05:30.394
And so whatever you need
to do that every day,

00:05:30.394 --> 00:05:33.107
you're thinking to myself, today matters.

00:05:33.107 --> 00:05:35.017
What I create today matters.

00:05:35.017 --> 00:05:37.139
It's going to last a
lifetime, it's that important.

00:05:37.139 --> 00:05:39.803
This next video that I make
has to be that important.

00:05:39.803 --> 00:05:41.823
This next product you make
has to be that important.

00:05:41.823 --> 00:05:43.792
That customer email
that you send out today

00:05:43.792 --> 00:05:44.952
has to be that important.

00:05:44.952 --> 00:05:46.505
I want to change that
person's life with this

00:05:46.505 --> 00:05:48.630
customer support email
that I'm about to send out.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.662
Whatever you do in your day to day work,

00:05:50.662 --> 00:05:52.468
your day to day job,
your day to day business,

00:05:52.468 --> 00:05:54.412
plus all the extra stuff
that you have to do to get

00:05:54.412 --> 00:05:57.812
your company off the
ground, make today count.

00:05:57.812 --> 00:05:59.938
And so the question of the
day today is, I'm curious,

00:05:59.938 --> 00:06:02.965
what is it for you that
increases the importance?

00:06:02.965 --> 00:06:06.724
What do you need to do on
a daily basis that will

00:06:06.724 --> 00:06:10.410
help you really feel that today counts?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.970
And hopefully by sharing
that, it encourages you

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.185
to do it more regularly,
but also gives ideas to

00:06:15.185 --> 00:06:17.034
everybody else in Believe Nation of things

00:06:17.034 --> 00:06:19.349
that they could try so
that they understand

00:06:19.349 --> 00:06:20.182
that today counts too.

00:06:20.182 --> 00:06:21.300
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.876
I'm really curious to
see what you have to say.

00:06:22.876 --> 00:06:25.050
And also, if you leave a
comment within the first couple

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.766
hours of this video going
live, you have the chance

00:06:26.766 --> 00:06:28.879
to win one of our two daily prizes.

00:06:28.879 --> 00:06:31.317
I also want to give a
shout-out to Laney Birk.

00:06:31.317 --> 00:06:33.125
Laney, thank you so much
for picking up a copy

00:06:33.125 --> 00:06:34.437
of my book, Your One Word.

00:06:34.437 --> 00:06:36.245
It really, really,
really means a lot to me,

00:06:36.245 --> 00:06:37.887
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:06:37.887 --> 00:06:39.146
Thank you guys again for watching.

00:06:39.146 --> 00:06:40.090
I believe in you.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.052
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:06:42.052 --> 00:06:44.957
And whatever your one word is, much love,

00:06:44.957 --> 00:06:46.342
and I'll see you again tomorrow morning

