00:06:48.817 --> 00:06:51.711
♫ I wake up every morning

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:55.128
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:06:57.163 --> 00:06:59.890
- The first thing I want
you to know that success

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.973
is not a destination, it's a journey.

00:07:04.685 --> 00:07:07.408
Think of success as a process.

00:07:07.408 --> 00:07:11.718
Let me illustrate it
and explain it this way.

00:07:11.718 --> 00:07:14.765
If you go to college, you work hard,

00:07:14.765 --> 00:07:17.609
and in four, five years,
depending on what kind of degree

00:07:17.609 --> 00:07:19.832
you're working on, and in today's society,

00:07:19.832 --> 00:07:21.217
sometimes six or seven years,

00:07:21.217 --> 00:07:24.779
but eventually comes
the day of graduation,

00:07:24.779 --> 00:07:26.979
and you're all excited,
your family is there,

00:07:26.979 --> 00:07:28.494
and your friends are there,

00:07:28.494 --> 00:07:30.514
and you're there with your
classmates, and you've got your

00:07:30.514 --> 00:07:33.233
cap and your gown, and you know
that there's going to be a time

00:07:33.233 --> 00:07:36.966
in that ceremony where you're
going to walk across stage,

00:07:36.966 --> 00:07:38.615
and the president, provost,

00:07:38.615 --> 00:07:39.823
somebody's going to shake your hand,

00:07:39.823 --> 00:07:42.386
hand you a diploma, congratulate
you, and you're going to

00:07:42.386 --> 00:07:44.226
get off the other side, and
they're going to have presents

00:07:44.226 --> 00:07:45.993
waiting for you, and
they'll be taking pictures,

00:07:45.993 --> 00:07:48.337
everybody will be shaking your
hand, say congratulations,

00:07:48.337 --> 00:07:51.635
today, you become a success,
you're a college graduate.

00:07:51.635 --> 00:07:55.802
Now, my friend, you did not
become a success the day

00:07:57.702 --> 00:07:59.869
that you got your diploma.

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:03.480
Now, what you did have happen
to you in that ceremony

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.313
is you got recognized for success.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:11.990
The diploma is recognition
of what you have done

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.879
the previous four or five years.

00:08:13.879 --> 00:08:17.015
You see, you were a success
in your freshman year

00:08:17.015 --> 00:08:19.418
when you decided to not drop out of school

00:08:19.418 --> 00:08:20.786
like some of your other classmates,

00:08:20.786 --> 00:08:22.423
and decided to stick to it.

00:08:22.423 --> 00:08:25.605
You were a success every
time you studied for a test,

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:27.844
and you were a success every
time you did a project,

00:08:27.844 --> 00:08:29.788
or did a writing assignment.

00:08:29.788 --> 00:08:33.333
You see, you were a
success all through school.

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:35.002
You're a success every day.

00:08:35.002 --> 00:08:38.020
Success is a daily thing,
not a destination thing.

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:42.094
The day you got the diploma,
you just got recognized

00:08:42.094 --> 00:08:45.261
for the success that you already were.

00:08:46.829 --> 00:08:49.068
Now that's very essential.

00:08:49.068 --> 00:08:53.235
Because so many times people
have a tendency to devalue

00:08:56.214 --> 00:08:57.714
the moment, today.

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:02.089
What they do is the greatly
value the destination,

00:09:02.089 --> 00:09:05.432
and so they kind of talk
about, well, when I get there,

00:09:05.432 --> 00:09:08.364
or if I arrive there, or when I do that,

00:09:08.364 --> 00:09:10.456
or when I accomplish this.

00:09:10.456 --> 00:09:14.345
And they don't understand
that success is a daily thing.

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:17.703
And I'm here to share with
you that the secret of success

00:09:17.703 --> 00:09:20.620
is determined by your daily agenda.

00:09:23.418 --> 00:09:25.422
In fact, I wrote a book a few years ago

00:09:25.422 --> 00:09:27.204
called Today Matters.

00:09:27.204 --> 00:09:29.221
I'm passionate about that
book because what it does,

00:09:29.221 --> 00:09:31.683
it helps you, it helps me to understand

00:09:31.683 --> 00:09:35.850
that we make decisions and
then we manage decisions.

00:09:36.928 --> 00:09:39.710
And too often we think,
I will make a decision,

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.890
for example, you're saying,
I'm going to make a decision

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.143
to be a coach.

00:09:43.143 --> 00:09:45.274
Or, I'm going to make a
decision, you know what,

00:09:45.274 --> 00:09:47.475
I'm going to make a decision
to be a public speaker.

00:09:47.475 --> 00:09:48.636
I want to be a communicator.

00:09:48.636 --> 00:09:52.333
Well, congratulations, you've
made a wonderful decision.

00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:55.000
Coach, speaking, good decisions.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.417
But that won't make
you a successful coach.

00:09:58.417 --> 00:10:01.654
That won't make you a
successful communicator.

00:10:01.654 --> 00:10:04.899
It's not the decision that makes you.

00:10:04.899 --> 00:10:09.170
You've got to make the
decision by managing it.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.222
And you manage the
decision on a daily basis.

00:10:12.222 --> 00:10:15.354
In other words, what
you want to be tomorrow,

00:10:15.354 --> 00:10:17.271
you've got to do today.

00:10:20.761 --> 00:10:24.428
You visualize tomorrow,
that gives you hope,

00:10:25.491 --> 00:10:27.983
and that's your motivation,
and that's your dream,

00:10:27.983 --> 00:10:30.879
and nothing wrong with that,
you've visualized tomorrow,

00:10:30.879 --> 00:10:32.546
but you value today.

00:10:35.318 --> 00:10:37.334
What's that mean?

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:41.621
That means that what I do
every day is either getting

00:10:41.621 --> 00:10:45.129
me closer to that vision,
that dream, that goal,

00:10:45.129 --> 00:10:49.046
or it's really driving
me farther away from it.

00:10:50.945 --> 00:10:54.893
You see, every day, we
are either repairing

00:10:54.893 --> 00:10:56.476
or we're preparing.

00:10:57.839 --> 00:10:59.446
You see, if I messed up yesterday,

00:10:59.446 --> 00:11:01.138
guess what I get to do today?

00:11:01.138 --> 00:11:02.818
Fix yesterday.

00:11:02.818 --> 00:11:05.528
In other words, if I didn't
do the right thing yesterday,

00:11:05.528 --> 00:11:07.990
what I've got to do today
is I've got to repair.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.300
I've got to go back,
make amends, backtrack,

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:12.674
put the car in reverse,
put my life in reverse,

00:11:12.674 --> 00:11:13.941
I've got to go back there.

00:11:13.941 --> 00:11:14.926
I've got to repair.

00:11:14.926 --> 00:11:17.106
Now, every day I spend repairing,

00:11:17.106 --> 00:11:19.745
I'm not spending preparing.

00:11:19.745 --> 00:11:22.703
Well, you see, we repair, when we fail

00:11:22.703 --> 00:11:25.649
to manage the decisions that we've made.

00:11:25.649 --> 00:11:28.903
We prepare when we, on a daily basis,

00:11:28.903 --> 00:11:31.057
manage the decisions that we've made.

00:11:31.057 --> 00:11:33.839
So your footprints to success

00:11:33.839 --> 00:11:36.589
are really footprints of success,

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.692
because every step that is made and taken,

00:11:41.692 --> 00:11:45.800
based upon the goals that
you have for your life,

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.658
and you're managing those goals correctly,

00:11:48.658 --> 00:11:53.224
every step is the progressive
realization of success

00:11:53.224 --> 00:11:54.860
in your life.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.748
And by the way, you'll get the diploma,

00:11:57.748 --> 00:12:01.284
you'll get the certificate,
but when you get that,

00:12:01.284 --> 00:12:05.451
you didn't arrive, it just
is another step in preparing

00:12:06.331 --> 00:12:09.442
you to reach your potential.

00:12:09.442 --> 00:12:13.964
Each one of us should live
our life as if we'll never

00:12:13.964 --> 00:12:16.691
learn everything we need to
learn, we'll never be able to

00:12:16.691 --> 00:12:18.616
accomplish everything
we wanted to accomplish,

00:12:18.616 --> 00:12:20.445
we won't be able to experience everything

00:12:20.445 --> 00:12:21.759
we wanted to experience.

00:12:21.759 --> 00:12:25.235
We should live our life every day hungry,

00:12:25.235 --> 00:12:29.152
understanding that we
are to live until we die.

00:12:31.257 --> 00:12:34.881
You see, I think success
can't be summarized in a

00:12:34.881 --> 00:12:39.048
flippant degree or a program
or a diploma or arrival.

00:12:41.241 --> 00:12:44.881
I think today if you
are learning to coach,

00:12:44.881 --> 00:12:46.738
if you are learning to speak,

00:12:46.738 --> 00:12:48.891
if you are doing the
things that are essential

00:12:48.891 --> 00:12:52.292
to the decisions, and you are
managing those decisions well.

00:12:52.292 --> 00:12:53.635
Can I say something to you?

00:12:53.635 --> 00:12:57.237
Congratulations, you
are already a success.

00:12:57.237 --> 00:12:58.570
Now, guess what?

00:12:59.673 --> 00:13:01.590
Over time, it shows up.

00:13:04.358 --> 00:13:05.831
You've heard the expression.

00:13:05.831 --> 00:13:07.582
You've maybe even said it yourself.

00:13:07.582 --> 00:13:09.455
You've heard the expression I'm sure,

00:13:09.455 --> 00:13:13.622
I've worked all my life to
become an overnight success.

00:13:14.652 --> 00:13:16.231
That's the way it works.

00:13:16.231 --> 00:13:18.185
All of a sudden somebody recognizes you.

00:13:18.185 --> 00:13:20.208
All of a sudden somebody
congratulates you.

00:13:20.208 --> 00:13:22.283
You didn't get good at that moment.

00:13:22.283 --> 00:13:25.069
You've been good for a long time.

00:13:25.069 --> 00:13:27.402
It just showed up some day.

